      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "54,049 images; 32 sign/alphabet classes; more than 40 participants. CC BY 4.0. Use the image ZIP and label CSV;\naudit all 32 labels rather than assuming 28 classes.\nTrain a small CNN on the original image format. Confirm camera crops resemble training inputs. Signer metadata may\nbe limited: a random image split is not proof of new-signer accuracy.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "54,049 images; 32 sign/alphabet classes; more than 40 participants. CC BY 4.0. Use the image ZIP and label CSV;\naudit all 32 labels rather than assuming 28 classes.\nTrain a small CNN on the original image format. Confirm camera crops resemble training inputs. Signer metadata may\nbe limited: a random image split is not proof of new-signer accuracy.",
