      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Publisher: 55 classes / 550 videos; around 10 clips per class. CC BY 4.0. Version 1 visibly lists dataset - rebirth.zip (393\nMB). Native signer description does not establish a diverse signer set.\nPrefer this for local relevance if files decode and a fluent signer validates the vocabulary. Start with 10–20 clear signs\nand collect additional people/sessions.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Publisher: 55 classes / 550 videos; around 10 clips per class. CC BY 4.0. Version 1 visibly lists dataset - rebirth.zip (393\nMB). Native signer description does not establish a diverse signer set.\nPrefer this for local relevance if files decode and a fluent signer validates the vocabulary. Start with 10–20 clear signs\nand collect additional people/sessions.",
