      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Official: 502 isolated signs, 75,300 samples, three professional signers; RGB/depth/skeleton. The 100-sign subset covers IDs\n0071–0170. Current page links to Drive; earlier SharePoint links are not a dependable path. Folder pages respond; bulk\naccess/completeness is untested.\nThe 1.95 GB mirror has no dataset card. Verify origin, license, label map, signer IDs and clip boundaries. Never treat loose\nJPG frames as independent word clips.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Official: 502 isolated signs, 75,300 samples, three professional signers; RGB/depth/skeleton. The 100-sign subset covers IDs\n0071–0170. Current page links to Drive; earlier SharePoint links are not a dependable path. Folder pages respond; bulk\naccess/completeness is untested.\nThe 1.95 GB mirror has no dataset card. Verify origin, license, label map, signer IDs and clip boundaries. Never treat loose\nJPG frames as independent word clips.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
