      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Group by person first, then session/source clip. Deduplicate and keep all frames/augmented copies together. Use\nseparate train/validation/test signers where possible. Fit normalizers on train only. Lock the test set and its manifest.",
