      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "A: small CNN + cross-entropy; compare MLP/Random Forest on valid landmarks.\nB: 32 time samples per isolated clip → GRU(64–128 hidden units) → class head. Resample or pad with a mask; retain\nframe order. Compare pooled features + linear classifier.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A: small CNN + cross-entropy; compare MLP/Random Forest on valid landmarks.\nB: 32 time samples per isolated clip → GRU(64–128 hidden units) → class head. Resample or pad with a mask; retain\nframe order. Compare pooled features + linear classifier.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
