      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Per model: accuracy, macro-F1, per-class recall, confusion matrix, counts and split details. Target macro-F1 ≥0.85\nalphabet and ≥0.75 words on held-out signers.\nLive checks: confirmed-letter character error rate ≤15%; false word accepts ≤5% on a fixed out-of-vocabulary/idle set;\naccepted output correctness and retry rate. Report results even when targets are missed.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Per model: accuracy, macro-F1, per-class recall, confusion matrix, counts and split details. Target macro-F1 ≥0.85\nalphabet and ≥0.75 words on held-out signers.\nLive checks: confirmed-letter character error rate ≤15%; false word accepts ≤5% on a fixed out-of-vocabulary/idle set;\naccepted output correctness and retry rate. Report results even when targets are missed.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
