      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "On the named demo laptop: target ≥10 processed frames/sec, p95 processing latency ≤250 ms, and word result ≤1 sec\nafter Stop. Show the capture-window duration separately. Test two hands, skin tones, lighting, distance, missing hands\nand repeated signs.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "On the named demo laptop: target ≥10 processed frames/sec, p95 processing latency ≤250 ms, and word result ≤1 sec\nafter Stop. Show the capture-window duration separately. Test two hands, skin tones, lighting, distance, missing hands\nand repeated signs.",
