      "text": "Team lead / QA / integration\n\nOwn scope, task board, dataset gate, reviews and demo\nnarrative. Keep coding load light; own the acceptance\nchecklist and supported-label review.\n\nLearn: GitHub flow, confusion matrices, API basics.\n\nDeliver: signed decisions Nov 6; weekly demos; release\nchecklist Dec 1.",
