      "text": "Data & evaluation engineer\n\nOwn source/license audit, manifests, grouped splits,\nconsented collection and reproducible reports. Pair with\nHisham and a fluent signer on labels.\n\nLearn: Python, pandas, video metadata, leakage,\nmacro-F1.\n\nDeliver: data gate Nov 6; v1 splits Nov 10; final report Nov\n28.",
