      "text": "Alphabet model engineer\n\nTrain/evaluate the image CNN. Test landmark feasibility,\ncompare a cheap baseline, inspect confusing classes and\nexport the complete bundle.\n\nLearn: PyTorch, CNNs, augmentation, checkpoints.\n\nDeliver: baseline Nov 13; webcam-ready bundle Nov 17.",
