      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "All six: 60–90 minutes Python/Git basics; run one sample and open one reviewed pull request.\nM2 teaches leakage/splits; M3 teaches tensors/CNNs; M4 teaches landmark quality; M5/M6 demonstrate mock request\n→ visible prediction. Mohab explains acceptance and keeps a decision log.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "All six: 60–90 minutes Python/Git basics; run one sample and open one reviewed pull request.\nM2 teaches leakage/splits; M3 teaches tensors/CNNs; M4 teaches landmark quality; M5/M6 demonstrate mock request\n→ visible prediction. Mohab explains acceptance and keeps a decision log.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
