      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Daily: async “done / next / blocked”; raise data blockers within 24 hours. Suggested Cairo-time meetings: Sunday and\nWednesday, 19:00–19:30. Tuesday demos Nov 10, 17 and 24.\nEach meeting: one working artifact, one result, one next decision. Two 30-minute teach-backs per week; rotate the\npresenter and note-taker.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Daily: async “done / next / blocked”; raise data blockers within 24 hours. Suggested Cairo-time meetings: Sunday and\nWednesday, 19:00–19:30. Tuesday demos Nov 10, 17 and 24.\nEach meeting: one working artifact, one result, one next decision. Two 30-minute teach-backs per week; rotate the\npresenter and note-taker.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
