      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Issue with owner + acceptance → short feature branch → small pull request → one peer review → meaningful checks\n→ merge. Keep main runnable; use mock models until bundles arrive. Members own their modules, and coordinate\nschema changes with both consumers.\nDefinition of done: runnable artifact, documented input/output, relevant evidence and a teammate who can reproduce it.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Issue with owner + acceptance → short feature branch → small pull request → one peer review → meaningful checks\n→ merge. Keep main runnable; use mock models until bundles arrive. Members own their modules, and coordinate\nschema changes with both consumers.\nDefinition of done: runnable artifact, documented input/output, relevant evidence and a teammate who can reproduce it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
