      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "signbridge/\n  README.md                 setup + demo + limits\n  pyproject.toml + lockfile  pinned Python stack\n  configs/                  model + preprocessing YAML\n  data/                     ignored media / features\n  manifests/                source, signer, clip, split CSV\n  labels/                   approved Arabic/English JSON\n  src/data/                 loaders, extraction, splits\n  src/vision/               crops, hands, pose, masks\n  src/models/               alphabet CNN / word GRU\n  src/inference/            routing, gates, text assembly\n  src/api/                  FastAPI + WebSocket\n  web/                      React UI + package lockfile\n  scripts/                  train, evaluate, export\n  tests/                    contracts + core behaviors\n  artifacts/                versioned model bundles\n  reports/                  metrics, plots, model cards\n  docs/                     decisions, sources, demo guide\n  .github/workflows/        lint + focused checks",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "signbridge/\n  README.md                 setup + demo + limits\n  pyproject.toml + lockfile  pinned Python stack\n  configs/                  model + preprocessing YAML\n  data/                     ignored media / features\n  manifests/                source, signer, clip, split CSV\n  labels/                   approved Arabic/English JSON\n  src/data/                 loaders, extraction, splits\n  src/vision/               crops, hands, pose, masks\n  src/models/               alphabet CNN / word GRU\n  src/inference/            routing, gates, text assembly\n  src/api/                  FastAPI + WebSocket\n  web/                      React UI + package lockfile\n  scripts/                  train, evaluate, export\n  tests/                    contracts + core behaviors\n  artifacts/                versioned model bundles\n  reports/                  metrics, plots, model cards\n  docs/                     decisions, sources, demo guide\n  .github/workflows/        lint + focused checks",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
