      "seed": 30338,
      "version": 10,
      "versionNonce": 2093271417,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794302461731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Agree, audit, connect\n\nWed 4 — kickoff: Hisham assigns owners, confirms capacity and target sign variety. All\nsix set up the same environment.\n\nThu 5 — M2 inventories sources; M3 tests image loading; M4 extracts one clip; M5/M6\nagree the API and connect a mock.\n\nFri 6 — G0: approve sources + 10–20 words, or activate collection. Freeze label IDs and\ncollection instructions.\n\nNov 7–9 — M2 validates/downloads and creates grouped splits. All six collect reviewed\nsamples if needed. M3/M4 build baselines; M5/M6 complete the mock UI flow.\n\nTue 10 — G1 demo: mock camera → text, extraction sample, source audit and locked\nsplit manifest.\n\nLearn together: Git flow, Python, leakage, model inputs. Each person ships one small\nreviewed artifact.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Agree, audit, connect\n\nWed 4 — kickoff: Hisham assigns owners, confirms capacity and target sign variety. All\nsix set up the same environment.\n\nThu 5 — M2 inventories sources; M3 tests image loading; M4 extracts one clip; M5/M6\nagree the API and connect a mock.\n\nFri 6 — G0: approve sources + 10–20 words, or activate collection. Freeze label IDs and\ncollection instructions.\n\nNov 7–9 — M2 validates/downloads and creates grouped splits. All six collect reviewed\nsamples if needed. M3/M4 build baselines; M5/M6 complete the mock UI flow.\n\nTue 10 — G1 demo: mock camera → text, extraction sample, source audit and locked\nsplit manifest.\n\nLearn together: Git flow, Python, leakage, model inputs. Each person ships one small\nreviewed artifact.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
