      "versionNonce": 1816558519,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794302461731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Baseline, collect, integrate\n\nNov 11–12 — M2 completes data QA and seals the test partition. M3 trains CNN; M4\ntrains word baseline. M5 serves model-shaped mocks; M6 finishes confirm/RTL flow.\n\nFri 13 — compare first validation metrics and confusion pairs. M3 exports alphabet v0;\nM4 reports extraction failures. Decide one improvement per model.\n\nNov 14–16 — M3/M5 check offline/served parity; M4/M5 agree sequence preprocessing.\nM2 audits any new recordings; Mohab runs usability cases.\n\nTue 17 — G2 demo: real alphabet from webcam to screen; initial word results if G0\npassed. Publish actual metrics and known errors.\n\nLearn together: tensors, CNN/GRU intuition, validation vs test. Pair model owners with\nthe backend owner.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Baseline, collect, integrate\n\nNov 11–12 — M2 completes data QA and seals the test partition. M3 trains CNN; M4\ntrains word baseline. M5 serves model-shaped mocks; M6 finishes confirm/RTL flow.\n\nFri 13 — compare first validation metrics and confusion pairs. M3 exports alphabet v0;\nM4 reports extraction failures. Decide one improvement per model.\n\nNov 14–16 — M3/M5 check offline/served parity; M4/M5 agree sequence preprocessing.\nM2 audits any new recordings; Mohab runs usability cases.\n\nTue 17 — G2 demo: real alphabet from webcam to screen; initial word results if G0\npassed. Publish actual metrics and known errors.\n\nLearn together: tensors, CNN/GRU intuition, validation vs test. Pair model owners with\nthe backend owner.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
