    {
      "id": "e-00267",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2150,
      "y": 5156.25,
      "width": 906.7856689453124,
      "height": 460,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#183247",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "card-00264"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b77",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 31274,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1159147545,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794302461731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Improve, join, freeze\n\nNov 18–19 — use validation errors to improve lighting/crops, class balance or features.\nM2 checks leakage; Mohab reviews scope. No new model family without evidence.\n\nFri 20 — M4 delivers the word bundle; M3 finalizes alphabet candidate. M5 verifies\ninference parity and thresholds for both modes.\n\nNov 21–23 — M5/M6 merge full flows: Start/Stop, unknown, reconnect, repeated signs\nand mode reset. M2 benchmarks on the demo laptop; team fixes failures together.\n\nTue 24 — G3: full team demo and feature/model freeze. Lock preprocessing,\nvocabulary, thresholds and evaluation commands.\n\nLearn together: latency profiling and failure analysis. Hand a teammate setup\ninstructions and watch them reproduce the app.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Improve, join, freeze\n\nNov 18–19 — use validation errors to improve lighting/crops, class balance or features.\nM2 checks leakage; Mohab reviews scope. No new model family without evidence.\n\nFri 20 — M4 delivers the word bundle; M3 finalizes alphabet candidate. M5 verifies\ninference parity and thresholds for both modes.\n\nNov 21–23 — M5/M6 merge full flows: Start/Stop, unknown, reconnect, repeated signs\nand mode reset. M2 benchmarks on the demo laptop; team fixes failures together.\n\nTue 24 — G3: full team demo and feature/model freeze. Lock preprocessing,\nvocabulary, thresholds and evaluation commands.\n\nLearn together: latency profiling and failure analysis. Hand a teammate setup\ninstructions and watch them reproduce the app.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
