    },
    {
      "id": "e-00271",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3153,
      "y": 5156.25,
      "width": 925.1000366210936,
      "height": 546.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#183247",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "card-00268"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 31742,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 746185495,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794302461731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Validate, rehearse, deliver\n\nNov 25–26 — M2 + Mohab run sealed-test and fresh-person evaluation once on the\nfrozen candidate. Measure macro-F1, CER, unknown rejection and p95 latency.\n\nFri 27 — fix critical defects. If changes affect a tested model, label that test as exposed\nand use a fresh reserved test for new claims. Reduce weak features honestly.\n\nSat 28 — M2 finalizes report; M3/M4 finish model cards; M5/M6 package install/run\ninstructions; Mohab edits the story and limitations.\n\nSun 29 — full rehearsal on the actual laptop; check offline start, camera, fallback clips\nand a recorded demo.\n\nMon 30 — buffer: only blockers, final backup, tagged release candidate and final\nrun-through.\n\nTue Dec 1 — Mohab leads delivery; all six explain their artifacts. Submit the reproducible\nrelease, evidence, board and demo.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Validate, rehearse, deliver\n\nNov 25–26 — M2 + Mohab run sealed-test and fresh-person evaluation once on the\nfrozen candidate. Measure macro-F1, CER, unknown rejection and p95 latency.\n\nFri 27 — fix critical defects. If changes affect a tested model, label that test as exposed\nand use a fresh reserved test for new claims. Reduce weak features honestly.\n\nSat 28 — M2 finalizes report; M3/M4 finish model cards; M5/M6 package install/run\ninstructions; Mohab edits the story and limitations.\n\nSun 29 — full rehearsal on the actual laptop; check offline start, camera, fallback clips\nand a recorded demo.\n\nMon 30 — buffer: only blockers, final backup, tagged release candidate and final\nrun-through.\n\nTue Dec 1 — Mohab leads delivery; all six explain their artifacts. Submit the reproducible\nrelease, evidence, board and demo.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
